#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_Mart/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Mart_Text_XSpecialIsCrucial"
msgid ""
"For any POKéMON match, X SPECIAL\n"
"is crucial.\p"
"It jacks up the power of some moves\n"
"even though it's only for one battle.$"
msgstr ""
"不管是什么样的宝可梦比赛，\n"
"特攻强化都是必不可少的。\p"
"虽然只在一场对战中有效，\n"
"但能大大提高某些招式的威力。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_Mart/scripts.inc:47
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Mart_Text_NoStrategyGuidesForBattleTent"
msgid ""
"They don't seem to sell any winning\n"
"strategy guides for the BATTLE TENT…\p"
"It seems one must rely on one's\n"
"own wits after all…$"
msgstr ""
"这里好像没有卖\n"
"对战帐篷的必胜攻略……\p"
"看来终究还是得靠\n"
"自己的智慧啊……$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_Mart/scripts.inc:53
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_Mart_Text_NestBallOnWeakenedPokemon"
msgid ""
"The NEST BALL works better on\n"
"weakened POKéMON.\p"
"VERDANTURF is the only place you can\n"
"buy it.$"
msgstr ""
"巢穴球对较弱的宝可梦\n"
"更有效。\p"
"只有在绿荫镇才能买到。$"
